    "findings": [
      "FxInstance has no exposed disable-one-track method; it can Kill/BreakLoop/SetBlackboardValue etc.",
      "GameObjectEffectHelper.StartEffectEvent returns Void, not an exposed FxInstance handle.",
      "ColorGrade node fields belong to worldEffect resource graph, not an exposed private per-instance track controller.",
      "lutWeight has evaluator/inputParameterOverride fields; setting a guessed blackboard key cannot guarantee only LUT changes or that original asset uses that key."
    ]
